      "value": "@{5b78615a5f267b35afbdcea4|full_name}: To reiterate: If an avatar goes beyond the collision check number you set then the ability for dynamic bones to collide is disabled on that avatar, but the dynamic bones keep working (graceful downgrade). \nThey did mention the feature in the patchnotes when it was added and have a documentation page for it at https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/avatar-dynamic-bone-limits. The problem is the implementation in-game is poor since it forces users to manually create/edit files. It's honestly a feature that most users don't know exists.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
