  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Yes I can turn off very poor performance avatars but then I'm stuck with the horrible grey robot (how about letting us choose something else instead of that too).\nBut many very poor avatars are purely because people put insane amounts of colliders into an avatar (3000+ I've seen), having a checkbox like the dynamic bone limit one would make those avatars still be able to be seen but not as performance heavy.\nThe grey robot really ruins immersion imo.",
